SUMMARY:The Wednesday Night Poker\, Euchre and Pool with Friends!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nLooking for a 
 fun and relaxed evening with good people? Come join me\, Steve Flemming\, 
 for a casual games night featuring poker\, euchre\, cards\, and pool. Whet
 her you're a seasoned player or just looking to learn\, everyone is welcom
 e. This isn't about high stakes or intense competition—it's about enjoyi
 ng great conversation\, sharing a few laughs\, meeting new friends\, and s
 pending time together in a friendly\, respectful atmosphere. Bring your se
 nse of humor\, your favorite card-playing strategies\, and get ready for a
 n enjoyable night of games and community. I look forward to seeing you aro
 und the table!\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good conversation 
 and great food awaits!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we c
 an anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n\\*This is just a fun event and obv
 iously we are only playing with poker chips. (All levels welcome) :)\n\n**
 Date:** Wednesday July 15th\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 6:00 
 pm -7:30 pm (If you can)\n(Ask for Steve from Meetup when you arrive or lo
 ok for us in our reserved section.\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** S
 moke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential
  area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and M
 t. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent De
 tails Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent 
 Details:\n**The Wednesday Night Poker\, Euchre and Pool with Friends!**\n\
 nJoin us for a relaxed and enjoyable evening of poker\, euchre\, pool\, gr
 eat conversation\, and the opportunity to meet new friends in a fun\, welc
 oming atmosphere.\n\n**Event Highlights**\n· Play poker\, euchre\, and ot
 her card games—whether you're experienced or just learning\n· Enjoy a f
 ew friendly games of pool while relaxing and getting to know new people\n
 · Meet new friends\, share some laughs\, and spend the evening in a respe
 ctful\, low-pressure social setting\n\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (if you a
 rrive between 6:00 pm and 6:50 pm\n(cash only please) (HST included)\n10 d
 ollars if you arrive after 6:51 pm\nor in advance by e transfer to **[stev
 eflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\n\\*Fee incl
 udes optional Karaoke later on in the evening\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum to
  support the venue and servers- this is greatly appreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
