SUMMARY:🏇🎉 A DAY AT THE RACES AT WOODBINE RACETRACK! 🎉🏇
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n🏇🎉 A DAY AT THE RACES AT WOO
 DBINE RACETRACK! 🎉🏇\n\nFast Horses\, Big Excitement & One of Our Mos
 t Popular Events\nIf you've never been to the horse races before\, you're 
 missing out on one of Toronto's most unique and entertaining afternoons.\n
 \nThere is something surprisingly exciting about watching these incredible
  athletes thunder down the track at full speed while thousands of people c
 heer them on.\n\nWhether you're placing a bet\, cheering for a horse based
  on its name\, or simply soaking in the atmosphere\, it's always a fun day
  out.\n\nThe best part? You don't need to know anything about horse racing
  to enjoy it.\n\nMany of our members come for the social experience\, the 
 excitement\, and the chance to try something completely different. Over th
 e years this has become one of our most popular annual events\, and every 
 time we go we have a fantastic afternoon together.\nAnd yes... betting is 
 part of the fun\, but it's completely optional. Some people bet\, some don
 't. Either way\, you'll have a great time.\n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Gro
 up:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleU
 d)\n\n***\n\n📖 Please Read Everything\nThere are TWO meetup options ava
 ilable.\n\n***\n\n🚍 TTC Meetup Option\n📍 Meetup Location: Islington 
 Station Bus Platform under the 37 Islington Bus sign\n🫎 I'll be wearing
  my Moose Hat\n⏰ Meetup Time: 11:15 AM\nWe are taking the 37 Islington B
 us.\n🚌 Bus Leaves: 11:24 AM Sharp\nI will only wait until the bus arriv
 es.\nIf you miss the bus\, you will need to make your own way to the racet
 rack.\n\n***\n\n🚗 Driving Meetup Option\n📍 Meetup Location: Outside 
 of Gate 10 at Woodbine Racetrack\n⏰ Meetup Time: 12:15 PM\n🫎 I'll be 
 wearing my Moose Hat\nThere is plenty of FREE parking available.\n\n***\n\
 n🏇 Race Information\n🏁 First Race: Approximately 1:10 PM\n🏁 Last 
 Race: Approximately 4:00 PM\nYou're welcome to leave at any time.\n\n***\n
 \n🎟️ What We'll Do\n\nOnce everyone arrives\, we'll find a spot toget
 her in the grandstand where we can enjoy the races as a group.\n\nWe'll:\n
 🏇 Watch the races\n💵 Place bets (if you'd like)\n🎉 Cheer for our 
 horses\n😊 Enjoy the atmosphere\n🍔 Grab food and drinks if we feel li
 ke it\n\nFor those interested\, there is also a VIP seating area available
  for approximately $10 per person if the group decides we'd like to upgrad
 e.\nMinimum bets start at just $2.\nAnd remember...\n\nYou do NOT have to 
 bet to enjoy the experience.\nMany people come just for the social outing 
 and excitement.\n\n***\n\n🎒 What to Bring\n🪪 Government-issued ID\n
 💵 CASH if you plan to place bets\n⚠️ Betting windows are cash only.
 \n🥪 Feel free to bring your own food and drinks.\nLet's bring a few sna
 cks to share with the group!\n\n***\n\n📚 New to Horse Racing?\nNever be
 en before?\nPerfect.\nMost people haven't.\nI'll explain how everything wo
 rks\, and you'll pick it up quickly.\nLearn more about betting on horses: 
 Click Here!\n\n***\n\n🎟️ Meetup Fee: $5 cash in person or e-transfer 
 to\n📧 [mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)\nTh
 is fee helps support the group and allows us to continue organizing events
  like this. Thank you for supporting community! 💖\n\n***\n\n🌈 Who Is
  This For?\nThis group is open to anyone who wants to be social and make f
 riends — whether single or not.\nWe also host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks 
 & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere
 's always something happening.\n\n***\n\nREMEMBER: You're welcome to just 
 show up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nAnd as always\, 
 sometimes things happen and events may need to be canceled — please keep
  an eye on updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 Organizer: Mathew\nQuestions? Post on t
 he event wall or email\n📧 [torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:
 torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)\nCome for the horses.\nStay for the e
 xcitement.\nLeave wondering why you didn't try this years ago. 🏇✨
