SUMMARY:🍦🦁 THE GREAT ST. CLAIR WEST ICE CREAM SAFARI! 🦁🍦
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🍦🦁 THE GREAT ST. CLAIR WES
 T ICE CREAM SAFARI! 🦁🍦\n\n**Six Sweet Stops\, Hidden Gems & One Deli
 cious Summer Adventure**\n\nForget the zoo...\n\nThis summer\, we're going
  on an **Ice Cream Safari!**\nJoin us as we explore one of Toronto's sweet
 est neighbourhoods\, stopping at **seven incredible dessert destinations**
  along St. Clair West.\n\nFrom authentic Italian gelato and Turkish ice cr
 eam to outrageous sundaes and one of the quirkiest cafés in the city\, ev
 ery stop has its own personality and something completely different to dis
 cover.\n\nThe stops are close together\, which means this isn't about raci
 ng from place to place—it's about taking our time\, sharing a few bites\
 , discovering new favourites\, and enjoying a fun afternoon with great peo
 ple.\n\n**Nobody is expected to buy something at every stop.**\nThink of i
 t as a dessert tasting adventure. Share with friends\, sample something ne
 w\, or simply enjoy the walk and the company.\nThe entire safari will take
  approximately **3 hours**.\n\n📲 **Don't Forget to Join Our WhatsApp Gr
 oup – \\[CLICK HERE\\!\\]\\(Click here to join\\)**\n\n***\n\n## 🍦 Ou
 r Safari Stops\n\n💩 **Poop Café** – Our starting point! One of Toron
 to's most unique cafés\, famous for its playful décor\, bubble waffles\,
  colourful desserts\, and ice cream served with a sense of humour. It's im
 possible not to laugh here.\n\n🍨 **Aura Gelato Artigianale** – Small-
 batch artisan gelato crafted the traditional Italian way using premium ing
 redients for rich\, authentic flavours.\nstyle granitas that are perfect o
 n a warm summer afternoon.\n\n🍌 **Bar Ape Gelato** – One of Toronto's
  most celebrated gelato makers\, known for handcrafted frozen treats\, pre
 mium ingredients\, and creative seasonal flavours that regularly attract l
 ong lineups.\n\n🍦 **Pink Ice Cream** – Experience traditional Turkish
 -style ice cream\, where the fun begins before your first bite. Watching i
 t being served is almost as entertaining as eating it!\n\n🍨 **Dutch Dre
 ams** – A true Toronto institution for over 40 years. Famous for giganti
 c portions\, outrageous sundaes\, and colourful creations that have become
  a summer tradition for generations.\n\n🍦 **Booyah** – We'll finish a
 t one of Toronto's favourite small-batch ice cream shops\, known for creat
 ive flavours\, homemade waffle cones\, and some of the city's best ice cre
 am sandwiches.\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂️ What We'll Do\n\nWe'll begin out
 side **The Poo Cafen** and slowly make our way along the neighbourhood\, v
 isiting each dessert stop while enjoying one of Toronto's most vibrant sum
 mer streets.\n\nAlong the way we'll:\n\n🍦 Discover seven unique dessert
  shops\n😋 Sample as much (or as little!) as you'd like\n📸 Take lots 
 of fun photos\n🚶 Enjoy a relaxed social walk\n😊 Meet new people and 
 spend the afternoon together\nThis isn't a challenge—it's an adventure.\
 n\n***\n\n## 🌦️ Weather & Expectations\n\nThis event will happen in m
 ost summer weather conditions.\nIf severe weather or thunderstorms are exp
 ected\, the event may be cancelled.\nPlease dress for the weather and wear
  comfortable walking shoes.\nThis is a social event\, not a race.\n\n***\n
 \n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** Outside **St. Clair 
 West Subway Station**\n🫎 I'll be wearing my **Moose Hat**\n⏰ **Meetup
  Time:** **1:00 PM**\nI will only wait **5 minutes.**\nEarly is on time.\n
 On time is late.\n\nWe will leave promptly and won't be able to spend time
  tracking down late arrivals.\n\n🏁 **End Point:** St. Clair West Subway
  Station (approximately **4:00 PM**)\n\n***\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**
 $5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **[mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mail
 to:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\nThis fee helps support the group and allo
 ws us to continue organizing events like this. Thank you for supporting ou
 r community! 💖\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comf
 ortable walking shoes\n💳 Spending money for treats\n😄 Your sweet too
 th!\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis group is open to anyone who
  wants to be social and make friends—whether single or not.\n\nWe also h
 ost:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽
 ️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere's always something happening.\n\n***\n\nR
 EMEMBER: You're welcome to just show up on the day if you're unsure about 
 your schedule.\nSometimes plans change and events may need to be cancelled
 \, so please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 **O
 rganizer:** Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email:\n📧 **[t
 orontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail
 .com)**\n\n**Come for the safari. Stay for the gelato. Leave with a new fa
 vourite ice cream shop... and probably a brain freeze.** 🍦🦁✨
